6. Removed complex imports that might be causing the dynamic import failure

This simplified version should help us identify if the issue is with the providers, the imports, or something else. If this works, we can gradually add back the necessary providers and functionality.

The main goal here is to get a basic working version that we can build upon, rather than trying to handle all the complex dependencies at once. Once we have this working, we can incrementally add back the required functionality.

